														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4531131">
									

<p>I enjoyed this. I think it is an interesting concept that was well executed. I liked what I saw of 5996's personality and the ethical dilemma it presented, as well as how the other SCP staff dealt with this scenario. The changelog at the end was a very nice touch. However, I think the incident log isn't <em>quite</em> clinical enough for an SCP article and needs some editing.</p>
<p>Just as an example: &quot;Mallowar falls silent and adopts a look of sudden confusion as SCP-5996 unknowingly enters within range of him.&quot; is a little clunky. Perhaps it could be changed to something like &quot;SCP-5996 enters (insert range). Mallowar stops speaking, appearing confused.&quot;</p>
<p>All in all, I really liked this. Upvoted.</p>

